# four values is set they must ALL be set (enforced in enforce_one_touch_secrets)
# so a half-configured store can never mint an invoice the webhook cannot verify.
# BTCPAY_API_KEY and BTCPAY_WEBHOOK_SECRET are true secrets and must arrive
