# Maximum-privacy Monero-direct checkout via a self-hosted monero-wallet-rpc.
# COEXISTS with BTCPay (that path stays switchable for BTC/Dash); Monero is a
# parallel, poll-only path with NO public checkout and NO inbound webhook. It is
# enabled by MONERO_WALLET_RPC_URL, but the hub additionally requires (H-2) that the
# RPC be authenticated and loopback/HTTPS-restricted before it will mint or settle an
# order. MONERO_WALLET_RPC_USER/PASS are MANDATORY; the PASS is a true secret and must
# arrive through the root-owned WINS_SECRETS_FILE, never a versioned defaults file
# (mirrors BTCPAY_API_KEY / BTCPAY_WEBHOOK_SECRET). The URL should point at the LOCAL
# wallet RPC (e.g. http://127.0.0.1:18083); it is never exposed.
MONERO_WALLET_RPC_URL_DEFAULT="${MONERO_WALLET_RPC_URL:-}"
MONERO_WALLET_RPC_USER_DEFAULT="${MONERO_WALLET_RPC_USER:-}"
MONERO_WALLET_RPC_PASS_DEFAULT=""
# Confirmations required before a received payment provisions access (10 is the
# standard Monero spendable/unlock depth). XMR/USD price feed for USD->XMR quotes
# defaults to Kraken's public ticker; MONERO_PRICE_MANUAL_USD (or the admin
# monero_price_manual_usd hub setting) pins a fixed USD-per-XMR rate and skips the
