Anti-Surveillance Download Camouflage:
Under digital surveillance or strict network monitoring? Open our Cloudflare Pages mirror (https://winsvpn.pages.dev). All TLS connections connect to global edge CDN infrastructure (SNI: winsvpn.pages.dev), camouflaging your download within generic platform traffic and shielding your IP from local DPI loggers.

Before first use, the app will ask you to accept Win's VPN legal terms by clickwrap.
Win's VPN Inc. operates the service. Win Empire LLC designs and builds the software and infrastructure.

Billing terms: recurring-plan cancellation ends access when PayPal reports it, including any unused part of a paid period, which is not refunded. Purchases and redemptions are final and non-refundable to the maximum extent permitted by law, without limiting non-waivable rights. Full terms: https://www.winsvpn.org/billing/.

Current legal version: {LEGAL_DOCUMENT_VERSION}
